# Large local-only media (founder/investor video etc.) -- never push binary
# media to this repo. Previously asserted as already-ignored in per-worktree
# CLAUDE.md kickoff files, but no such pattern actually existed here (caught
# 2026-08-27, infra lane audit -- a 56MB FounderVideo.mov was sitting
# untracked at repo root with nothing stopping a future `git add -A` from
# sweeping it in).
*.mov

# Real hook collector output (backend/scripts/hook_wrapper.py,
# example_hook_settings.json) -- session tool_input/tool_output content,
# redacted (trace_redaction.py) but still real transcript data, and
# untracked by default gets caught by `git add -A`/`-u`. Confirmed a
# real gap, not theoretical: firing hooks for real during this session's
# own work (handoff item 4) produced .claude/traces/ with nothing
# excluding it.
.claude/traces/
.claude/settings.local.json
backend/logs/

